<title>EGYPT: Egypt share index up 1.7 pct to 13th record high.</title>
<headline>Egypt share index up 1.7 pct to 13th record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index added another 1.72 percent to close at a record 394.6 points on Tuesday, its 13th high in as many days, the Capital Markets Authority said.</p>
<p>It said the index rose 6.68 points from 387.92 at the end of trading on Monday.</p>
